# Set-Tai show script (format: docs/LIBRARIES-AND-SHOWS.md, "Show scripts").
# Roles are names used below; the right side is ANY character id (try angel=gajju, satan=billa).
title: Satan vs Angel
cast: angel=angel, satan=devil

# 1. Angel flies in, then hovers silently in one place
at 0.0: angel enter left to 0.68 0.40 in 2.4
at 2.4: angel hover; angel turn right; angel face sleepy

# 2. Satan comes in from the edge of the display
at 2.8: satan enter left to 0.22 0.62 in 1.3
at 4.1: satan hover; satan look angel; satan face evil

# 3. Satan shoots fireballs fast
at 4.6: satan do throw for 2.2; satan throw fireball at angel every 0.3 x7 speed 1.5

# 4. When a fireball gets near Angel, she vanishes (generic proximity rule: any prop, any role)
when fireball near angel within 0.08: angel vanish in 0.5; satan say "Hee-hee! 😈" for 1.4

# 5. Angel is back, wakes and sees Satan
at 7.6: angel appear at 0.74 0.36 in 0.6
at 8.2: angel face wake; angel look satan
at 8.8: satan stop; satan face angry

# Satan's red lines from the eyes; Angel's shield stops them
at 9.3: satan ray eyes to angel red for 2.2
at 9.6: angel hold shield; angel do raise_shield for 1.9; angel face determined
at 11.6: angel drop

# Fire rays from Satan's hands vs Angel's powerful yellow rays: they clash
at 12.0: satan do cast_hands for 4.2; satan ray hands to angel red for 4.2
at 12.3: angel do cast_hands for 3.9; angel ray hands to satan yellow for 3.9
at 12.4: stage clash satan angel for 4.0

# The clash falls onto the display and the glass cracks
at 14.6: stage drop clash in 0.8
at 15.4: stage crack at clash
at 15.4: both stop; both face shocked; both look crack

# A one-second wide-eyed scream at the cracked glass
at 16.4: both face scream for 1

# Both look at each other, stop fighting, say sorry in fear
at 18.0: satan look angel; angel look satan
at 18.6: both face fear; both do cower for 2.6
at 19.0: both say "sorry bro" for 2.0

# Both disappear in their own vanish style (Satan red smoke, Angel white smoke)
at 21.4: satan vanish in 0.7; angel vanish in 0.7
end at 22.6
